    "final_answer": "I have successfully found the answer to the question. Here is the response:\n\n## Answer: How do I know whether my booking has been cancelled?\n\nAccording to Booking.com's Customer Service / Help Center, under the **Cancellation (取消)** section, the answer to \"我如何知晓订单是否已被取消？\" (How do I know whether my booking has been cancelled?) is:\n\n**\"After you cancel your booking, you will receive a confirmation email. Please check your inbox or spam/junk folder. If you have not received this email within 24 hours after the cancellation, please contact the accommodation provider to confirm whether your booking has been cancelled.\"**\n\n### Task Summary:\n1. ✅ Navigated to https://www.booking.com/\n2. ✅ Found the Customer Service / Help Center (客户支持 / 帮助中心) section\n3. ✅ Navigated to the Cancellation (取消) category\n4. ✅ Found the question \"我如何知晓订单是否已被取消？\" (How do I know whether my booking has been cancelled?)\n5. ✅ Retrieved the answer from the page\n\n**Key takeaway:** The way to know if your booking has been cancelled is to look for the confirmation email in your inbox or spam folder within 24 hours after cancellation. If no email is received within that timeframe, you should contact the accommodation provider directly.",
